{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Day Fishing is a gamified focus tool where you catch fish while completing real-life tasks. Reel in and record new species, decorate your favorite cozy fishing spot, and customize your soundscape to create a custom vibe to help you relax and boost concentration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/4c834abeb952b0342547d808013df8a9.poster.avif?t=1770088331\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/4c834abeb952b0342547d808013df8a9.webm?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/4c834abeb952b0342547d808013df8a9.mp4?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAXING ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delicate sounds and serene visual effects like gentle rainfall, a rustling campfire, and even fireflies on a warm summer night, provide a customizable ambiance to help you decompress and feel at ease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/82813de1277495696104ccacdea330b5.poster.avif?t=1770088331\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/82813de1277495696104ccacdea330b5.webm?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/82813de1277495696104ccacdea330b5.mp4?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IDLE FISHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tackle upgrades, catch 50+ species of fish, and track your progress in the fishdex</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/58e5cfed5bde9ae10ccbac9572e68771.poster.avif?t=1770088331\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/58e5cfed5bde9ae10ccbac9572e68771.webm?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/58e5cfed5bde9ae10ccbac9572e68771.mp4?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE FOCUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Day Fishing has several productivity tools designed to help you have better days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/0f1299eb8c85faa0233b138ed003f886.poster.avif?t=1770088331\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/0f1299eb8c85faa0233b138ed003f886.webm?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/0f1299eb8c85faa0233b138ed003f886.mp4?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADORABLE CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance and decorate your fishing camp\u00a0with your hard earned fish coins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/2078dc453f822956a74e06d2a859a251.poster.avif?t=1770088331\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/2078dc453f822956a74e06d2a859a251.webm?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/2078dc453f822956a74e06d2a859a251.mp4?t=1770088331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUTE COMPANIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fishing trip would be complete without your kitty or your pup by your side!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable visual and audio effects with dozens of combinations to help you relax and focus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tackle upgrades, idly catch 50+ species of fish, and track your progress in the fishdex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Pomodoro timers to facilitate your day-to-day accomplishments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your todo list</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize  effects and animations to promote a state of flow while staying on top of your real-world tasks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a frog. Batteries not included.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649860?t=1770088331","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/ce9524128da86a715027e6a22ae50ce57a43a97c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770088331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/e38af47878591d472fa6ea8593a8e4b39c29118d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770088331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/e38af47878591d472fa6ea8593a